//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//
// Compiles decode/profile_decode.vx with the modules of src/, so that a change to src/ that breaks
// the profiler fails here. The profiler needs the weights of the 30B model to run, so this test
// only compiles it.
//
// RUN: vxc %S/../decode/profile_decode.vx --package qwen=%S/../src --host default --machine $VX_FLEET/m4-uma.vx --action emit-mlir > /dev/null
